    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/fc29be4a893c3d692a7ca7495a749cc4.avif?t=1749159881\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span><strong>Unleash your imagination and craft your ultimate airship!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes of Elysium: Airship Builder is a standalone experience that lets you bring your wildest airship designs to life using the same powerful mechanics that will shape your adventure in the full survival RPG.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/df4066595e9a1dcf21c475b50cc39977.poster.avif?t=1749159881\" width=615 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/df4066595e9a1dcf21c475b50cc39977.webm?t=1749159881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Design Your Airship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize every aspect of your airship - from its hull and sails to its defenses and interiors. Whether you're crafting a majestic flying fortress, a nimble scout ship, or a luxurious floating palace, the skies are yours to conquer. The possibilities are endless as you flex your creativity\u00a0 to create the ultimate airship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/e2de44756a43a8df7e47bf266c96050b.poster.avif?t=1749159881\" width=615 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/e2de44756a43a8df7e47bf266c96050b.webm?t=1749159881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Save Your Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your creations aren\u2019t just for show - they\u2019re future-proof! When Echoes of Elysium officially launches, your airships will serve as blueprints, giving you a head start in mastering the skies and preparing for the challenges ahead. Build now and fly later!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/948b091111c622afd73b5f93d772880a.poster.avif?t=1749159881\" width=615 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/948b091111c622afd73b5f93d772880a.webm?t=1749159881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Join the community and compete for glory!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want to see your airships take flight! Share your creations on social media using the hashtag #AirshipBuilder to be featured in our community spotlight. Keep an eye on our social channels for exciting updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skies await. Are you ready to build your legacy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/00b4703563678588770109cedc8db89c.webp?t=1749159881\" width=800 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/9a509c15acf0aaa62ddeb9f69698bf05.avif?t=1749159881\" data-has-big width=800 height=569 /></span><strong>What to expect from the full game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Echoes of Elysium</i>, you\u2019ll soar through the skies on your custom airships, exploring floating islands, uncovering ancient secrets, and battling an army of clockwork enemies. Whether you\u2019re charting your own course solo or teaming up with friends, your airship will be your ultimate base of operations in a procedurally generated world teeming with danger, mystery, and adventure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <i>Echoes of Elysium</i> to stay up to date on the full Survival RPG and get a sneak peek into development.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/fc29be4a893c3d692a7ca7495a749cc4.avif?t=1749159881\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span><strong>Unleash your imagination and craft your ultimate airship!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes of Elysium: Airship Builder is a standalone experience that lets you bring your wildest airship designs to life using the same powerful mechanics that will shape your adventure in the full survival RPG.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/df4066595e9a1dcf21c475b50cc39977.poster.avif?t=1749159881\" width=615 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/df4066595e9a1dcf21c475b50cc39977.webm?t=1749159881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Design Your Airship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize every aspect of your airship - from its hull and sails to its defenses and interiors. Whether you're crafting a majestic flying fortress, a nimble scout ship, or a luxurious floating palace, the skies are yours to conquer. The possibilities are endless as you flex your creativity\u00a0 to create the ultimate airship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/e2de44756a43a8df7e47bf266c96050b.poster.avif?t=1749159881\" width=615 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/e2de44756a43a8df7e47bf266c96050b.webm?t=1749159881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Save Your Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your creations aren\u2019t just for show - they\u2019re future-proof! When Echoes of Elysium officially launches, your airships will serve as blueprints, giving you a head start in mastering the skies and preparing for the challenges ahead. Build now and fly later!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/948b091111c622afd73b5f93d772880a.poster.avif?t=1749159881\" width=615 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/948b091111c622afd73b5f93d772880a.webm?t=1749159881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Join the community and compete for glory!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want to see your airships take flight! Share your creations on social media using the hashtag #AirshipBuilder to be featured in our community spotlight. Keep an eye on our social channels for exciting updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skies await. Are you ready to build your legacy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/00b4703563678588770109cedc8db89c.webp?t=1749159881\" width=800 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269310/extras/9a509c15acf0aaa62ddeb9f69698bf05.avif?t=1749159881\" data-has-big width=800 height=569 /></span><strong>What to expect from the full game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Echoes of Elysium</i>, you\u2019ll soar through the skies on your custom airships, exploring floating islands, uncovering ancient secrets, and battling an army of clockwork enemies. Whether you\u2019re charting your own course solo or teaming up with friends, your airship will be your ultimate base of operations in a procedurally generated world teeming with danger, mystery, and adventure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <i>Echoes of Elysium</i> to stay up to date on the full Survival RPG and get a sneak peek into development.</p>",
